At 2,000 elements the panel was 2 solved / 1 failed, so the harness has moved to 4,000. This confirms the weakness is not the explicit pair haystack; vendors are executing the short formulas. If that persists through the harness’s budget, the honest outcome will be non-shipment (or a harness budget-bound park), not a hardness claim.
