+    statement = f"""Exact sumset/difference-set cardinalities
+
+For a finite set A of integers, define
+  A+A = {{a+b : a is in A and b is in A}},
+  A-A = {{a-b : a is in A and b is in A}}.
+Repeated results count only once. Order in these sets does not matter.
